    "message": "Add native Gaussian reset sampling and detector proposals\n\nImplement centered and displaced PNR resets in C++, with diagonal and coherent-reference rejection. Record same-input Frugal quality comparisons, count-tail failures, and repeated OpenBLAS baselines up to 8176 outputs.\n\nPreserve all exploratory failures and verify the public build against 400000 archived samples. Full suite: 812 run, 783 passed, zero failures/errors; historical skips retained. No universal or quantum-advantage claim.",
